   - Dynamic availability: was 99%, expect very close to that
   - Per-zone CAISO_NP15: should now show correctly
4. Fix the Cell 41/43/48 shadowing issues in the same commit
5. Commit as: "Rebuild zone metadata from dc_capacity_mapped.csv;
