MISO_ILLINOIS value came from, and rebuild the MISO section of
the zone metadata programmatically from the CSV.** That's the
single most important thing. Everything else can slip a day if
needed, but the MISO_ILLINOIS double-count is the largest
single error in the current analysis and it moves the headline
number in the aggressive direction. Fix that first, even if you
don't get to PJM/CAISO/NYISO/ERCOT on the same day.

